    "title": "Uttarakhand CM Dhami says over 25,000 women in Chamoli became 'Lakhpati Didis', Congress MLA praises development | Hindustan Times",
    "text": "Women's empowerment focus\nDhami said strengthening women's livelihoods remained a priority for the government. He said over 42,000 women in Chamoli had been linked with self-help groups and more than 25,000 had become Lakhpati Didis. He urged people to participate in the ongoing public outreach campaign and avail the benefits of government welfare schemes, adding that the administration was committed to ensuring development reached every eligible beneficiary.",
